Research decision:
- Exact-label searches returned OpenCode telemetry pages whose capability cells explicitly identify their values as no-data placeholders. Usage counts are not quality benchmarks and were not converted into scores. [OpenCode entry](https://opencode.ai/data/compare/unknown/mai-experimental-test/zhipuai/glm-5-1)
- Microsoft's [official model announcements](https://microsoft.ai/news-categories/models/page/2/) identify MAI-1-preview and MAI-Thinking-1, but do not establish that this experimental label maps to either. Microsoft authorship is therefore not assumed.
- This is an evidence gap, not proof that the experimental deployment never existed.

